        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1020414019,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020414,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 19,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "不……应该说，直到不久前，我还固执地认为剧团不需要名声和地位，/n一直拒绝参加各种奖项竞赛。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10204140180",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 79,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 20103,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1020414020,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020414,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 20,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "如今我依然觉得，所谓名声不过是空虚的东西……/n但没有人气，剧团就难以维持，这也是事实。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10204140190",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 107,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 20103,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1020414021,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020414,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 21,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "所以我想着，稍微换个方式，/n把Eden的实力直接展示给全世界看看也不错。",
      "BgmFileName": "999",
      "VoiceFileName": "10204140200",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 103,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 15,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 20103,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1020414022,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020414,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 22,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "因此……我们Eden决定在下一场公演中，/n以德国的“普罗米修斯奖”为目标！",
      "BackgroundCharacterImageFileName": "142390_0",
      "BgmFileName": "401",
      "VoiceFileName": "10204140210",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1020414023,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020414,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 23,
      "SpeakerName": "时雨",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（！普罗米修斯奖……！）",
      "BackgroundCharacterImageFileName": "142390_0",
      "VoiceFileName": "10204140220",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "205"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1020414024,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020414,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 24,
      "SpeakerName": "容",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "原来如此，你打的是这个主意。/n要冲击普罗米修斯奖……你是认真的吗，初魅？",
      "BackgroundCharacterImageFileName": "142390_0",
      "VoiceFileName": "10204140230",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "204"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1020414025,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020414,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 25,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "呵，你觉得我会为了说个玩笑，/n还特地把大家全都集合起来吗？",
      "BackgroundCharacterImageFileName": "142390_0",
      "VoiceFileName": "10204140240",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1020414026,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020414,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 26,
      "SpeakerName": "容",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "不，这倒也是……可是普罗米修斯奖的话，/n和其他奖项比起来，也不是那么容易拿的吧？",
      "BackgroundCharacterImageFileName": "142390_0",
      "VoiceFileName": "10204140250",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "204"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1020414027,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020414,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 27,
      "SpeakerName": "仁花子",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "是这样吗，容容？这个奖确实经常被提到呢！",
      "BackgroundCharacterImageFileName": "142390_0",
      "VoiceFileName": "10204140260",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "203"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1020414028,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020414,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 28,
      "SpeakerName": "容",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "嗯……普罗米修斯奖是欧洲的戏剧奖项之一，/n它的评审标准在近年非常少见，更重视艺术性和原创性。",
      "BackgroundCharacterImageFileName": "142390_0",
      "VoiceFileName": "10204140270",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "204"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1020414029,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020414,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 29,
      "SpeakerName": "容",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "剧团的知名度、人气，甚至Sense都没法成为捷径……。/n真正要比的，是作为舞台综合艺术的整体实力。",
      "BackgroundCharacterImageFileName": "142390_0",
      "VoiceFileName": "10204140280",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "204"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1020414030,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020414,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 30,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "没错。不同于重视Sense的世界演剧联盟，/n这是一个会评价古典戏剧真正魅力的优秀奖项！",
      "BackgroundCharacterImageFileName": "142390_0",
      "VoiceFileName": "10204140290",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1020414031,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020414,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 31,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我对所谓奖项竞赛本来毫无兴趣，/n但唯独这个奖，我认为值得关注。",
      "BackgroundCharacterImageFileName": "142390_0",
      "VoiceFileName": "10204140300",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1020414032,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020414,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 32,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "那些只靠人气的剧团，害怕真正检验实力，甚至连报名都不敢。/n怎么样，难道不想拿Eden的实力去撞一撞吗？",
      "BackgroundCharacterImageFileName": "142390_0",
      "VoiceFileName": "10204140310",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1020414033,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020414,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 33,
      "SpeakerName": "仁花子",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我觉得特别好！普罗米修斯奖……！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10204140320",
      "CharacterMotions": [
